---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Articles"
  description="Articles and notes by Bernhard Hauke."
>
  <section class="page-intro" data-section-label="03 / Articles" data-animate>
    <h1>Articles are coming soon.</h1>
    <p>
      This space is reserved for notes on building products, interfaces, and
      technical systems. The structure is ready, but the public index stays
      quiet until I find the first pieces are worth publishing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section
    class="empty-state"
    data-section-label="03.1 / Queue"
    data-animate
    style="--delay: 80ms"
  >
    <div class="empty-state-meta">
      <span>draft buffer</span>
      <span>public index closed</span>
    </div>
    <h2>No published notes yet.</h2>
    <p>
      A few drafts are still behind the panel. Once they have enough shape, this
      will become a compact, dated index.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
